## 三、全套架构伪代码（Hilt + OkHttp拦截器 + Retrofit + Api + Repository + ViewModel + Activity）

### 1. 项目依赖
```gradle
// Hilt
implementation "com.google.dagger:hilt-android:2.48"
kapt "com.google.dagger:hilt-android-compiler:2.48"

// 网络
implementation 'com.squareup.okhttp3:okhttp:4.11.0'
implementation 'com.squareup.retrofit2:retrofit:2.9.0'
implementation 'com.squareup.retrofit2:converter-gson:2.9.0'
```

### 2. Application 全局入口
```java
@HiltAndroidApp
public class App extends Application{
    // Hilt 自动初始化全局单例容器
}
```

### 3. 自定义全局拦截器（你之前问的：加Header+打印流不冲突）
```java
public class NetInterceptor implements Interceptor{
    @Override
    public Response intercept(Chain chain) throws IOException {
        // 1.统一添加 Token、设备头
        Request request = chain.request().newBuilder()
                .addHeader("token",TokenManager.getToken())
                .build();

        Response response = chain.proceed(request);
        ResponseBody body = response.body();
        if(body == null) return response;

        // 2.复制流打印日志，不影响上层解析
        String json = body.string();
        Log.e("响应数据",json);

        // 3.重建 Body 放行
        ResponseBody newBody = ResponseBody.create(body.contentType(),json);
        return response.newBuilder().body(newBody).build();
    }
}
```

### 4. 网络 Module（Hilt 提供 Retrofit 全套实例）
```java
@Module
@InstallIn(SingletonComponent.class)
public class NetModule {

    // 提供 OkHttp
    @Provides
    @Singleton
    public static OkHttpClient provideOkHttp(){
        return new OkHttpClient.Builder()
                .addInterceptor(new NetInterceptor())
                .connectTimeout(15,TimeUnit.SECONDS)
                .build();
    }

    // 提供 Retrofit
    @Provides
    @Singleton
    public static Retrofit provideRetrofit(OkHttpClient client){
        return new Retrofit.Builder()
                .baseUrl("https://api.xxx.com/")
                .client(client)
                .addConverterFactory(GsonConverterFactory.create())
                .build();
    }

    // 提供 Api 接口（动态代理）
    @Provides
    @Singleton
    public static ApiService provideApi(Retrofit retrofit){
        return retrofit.create(ApiService.class);
    }
}
```

### 5. Retrofit 接口
```java
public interface ApiService{
    @GET("user/data")
    Call<UserBean> getUserData();
}
```

### 6. Repository 层（构造注入 Api）
```java
public class UserRepository {

    private final ApiService api;

    // Hilt 自动注入
    @Inject
    public UserRepository(ApiService api){
        this.api = api;
    }

    public void getUser(Callback<UserBean> callback){
        api.getUserData().enqueue(callback);
    }
}
```

### 7. ViewModel 层（注入 Repository）
```java
@HiltViewModel
public class UserViewModel extends ViewModel{

    private final UserRepository repo;

    // Hilt 自动注入
    @Inject
    public UserViewModel(UserRepository repo){
        this.repo = repo;
    }

    public void loadData(){
        repo.getUser(new Callback<UserBean>(){
            @Override
            public void onResponse(Call<UserBean> call, Response<UserBean> response) {
                // 数据回调
            }
            @Override
            public void onFailure(Call<UserBean> call, Throwable t) {}
        });
    }
}
```

### 8. Activity 使用
```java
@AndroidEntryPoint
public class MainActivity extends AppCompatActivity {

    // 自动注入 ViewModel
    @InjectViewModel
    UserViewModel viewModel;

    @Override
    protected void onCreate(Bundle savedInstanceState) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState);
        viewModel.loadData();
    }
}
```

