## 三、全套标准伪代码（放到最后，简洁完整版）
### 1. 网络请求接口（注解 + 空方法，无实现）
```java
public interface ApiService {
    @GET("api/user/list")
    Call<BaseBean> getUserList(@Query("page") int page);

    @POST("api/login")
    Call<BaseBean> login(@Body LoginReq req);
}
```

### 2. 自定义拦截器（解决：加头 + 打印响应 + 复制流不冲突）
```java
public class CommonInterceptor implements Interceptor {
    @Override
    public Response intercept(Chain chain) throws IOException {
        // 1. 请求阶段：统一添加公共Header
        Request oldRequest = chain.request();
        Request newRequest = oldRequest.newBuilder()
                .addHeader("token", TokenUtil.getToken())
                .addHeader("device", "android")
                .build();

        // 2. 发起网络请求
        Response response = chain.proceed(newRequest);
        ResponseBody body = response.body();
        if (body == null) return response;

        // 3. 读取副本流：打印日志、判断错误码
        String responseStr = body.string();
        Log.e("网络日志","响应数据：" + responseStr);

        // 模拟401 Token过期处理
        if (checkTokenExpire(responseStr)){
            // 刷新Token、重新请求
            String newToken = refreshToken();
            Request retryReq = newRequest.newBuilder()
                    .removeHeader("token")
                    .addHeader("token",newToken)
                    .build();
            return chain.proceed(retryReq);
        }

        // 4. 重点：重建body，恢复原始流，给上层使用
        ResponseBody newBody = ResponseBody.create(body.contentType(), responseStr);
        return response.newBuilder()
                .body(newBody)
                .build();
    }
}
```

### 3. Retrofit 全局单例初始化（Builder建造者模式）
```java
public class RetrofitUtil {
    private static Retrofit sRetrofit;

    public static Retrofit getInstance(){
        if (sRetrofit == null){
            OkHttpClient client = new OkHttpClient.Builder()
                    .addInterceptor(new CommonInterceptor()) // 绑定自定义拦截器
                    .connectTimeout(15, TimeUnit.SECONDS)
                    .build();

            sRetrofit = new Retrofit.Builder()
                    .baseUrl("https://xxx.com/")
                    .client(client)
                    .addConverterFactory(GsonConverterFactory.create()) // 解析工厂
                    .build();
        }
        return sRetrofit;
    }
}
```

### 4. 动态代理创建接口 + 发起请求
```java
// 动态代理生成接口代理对象
ApiService api = RetrofitUtil.getInstance().create(ApiService.class);

// 异步请求
api.getUserList(1).enqueue(new Callback<BaseBean>() {
    @Override
    public void onResponse(Call<BaseBean> call, Response<BaseBean> response) {
        // 业务层正常拿数据
    }
    @Override
    public void onFailure(Call<BaseBean> call, Throwable t) {

    }
});
```

